---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { vectorDatabaseSeries } from '../../data/vectorDatabaseSeries';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Build Your Own Vector Database · xuan.z 的个人笔记"
  description="从为什么需要向量数据库，到 Flat Search、IVF、HNSW 和最终 Mini Vector DB 实践的系列学习路线。"
>
  <section class="series-page shell">
    <a class="back-link" href={withBase('/articles/')}>← 返回文章</a>

    <header class="series-hero">
      <p class="kicker">LEARNING SERIES</p>
      <h1>Build Your Own Vector Database</h1>
      <p>不从产品 API 开始背，而是沿着一个问题一路往下推：为什么需要语义检索？暴力扫描哪里慢？IVF 和 HNSW 分别在省什么？最后把这些概念做成一个能跑的 Mini Vector DB。</p>
      <div class="hero-meta"><span>共 {vectorDatabaseSeries.length} 篇</span><span>原理 → 手写 → 工程化</span><span>边学边实现</span></div>
    </header>

    <section class="method-card">
      <strong>这个系列的学习方式</strong>
      <p>每篇只解决一个核心问题，并固定包含：本文目录 → 推导过程 → 小实验/实现 → 本章复盘 → 自检问题。不会把所有知识塞进一篇超长文档。</p>
    </section>

    <div class="roadmap">
      {vectorDatabaseSeries.map((article) => (
        article.href ? (
          <a class="roadmap-item published" href={withBase(article.href)}>
            <span class="index">{article.index}</span>
            <span class="copy"><strong>{article.title}</strong><small>{article.focus}</small></span>
            <span class="status">已发布 →</span>
          </a>
        ) : (
          <div class="roadmap-item planned">
            <span class="index">{article.index}</span>
            <span class="copy"><strong>{article.title}</strong><small>{article.focus}</small></span>
            <span class="status">待学习</span>
          </div>
        )
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .series-page { max-width: 980px; padding-block: 42px 84px; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .series-hero { padding: 36px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: rgba(255,253,248,.76); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .kicker { margin: 0; color: var(--sage); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  h1 { margin: 10px 0 15px; font-family: var(--hand-font); font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px); line-height: 1.18; }
  .series-hero > p:not(.kicker) { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-family: var(--body-font); line-height: 1.9; }
  .hero-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 11px; }
  .method-card { margin: 22px 0 16px; padding: 20px 22px; border: 1px solid #cbd6c2; border-radius: 15px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #eef3e9, #f8f7f1); }
  .method-card strong { color: #4e5549; font-family: var(--body-font); }
  .method-card p { margin: 7px 0 0; color: #646057; font-family: var(--body-font); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .roadmap { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .roadmap-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr auto; gap: 16px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255,253,248,.7); color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .roadmap-item.published { border-color: #becbb5; background: #f1f5ec; transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
  .roadmap-item.published:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(82,75,63,.07); }
  .roadmap-item.planned { opacity: .72; }
  .index { color: var(--sage); font-family: var(--hand-font); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
  .copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; }
  .copy strong { color: #4f4b43; font-family: var(--body-font); font-size: 15px; }
  .copy small { color: var(--ink-faint); font-family: var(--body-font); line-height: 1.55; }
  .status { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .published .status { color: var(--sage-dark); font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .series-page { width: min(100% - 28px, 980px); padding-top: 24px; }
    .series-hero { padding: 26px 22px; }
    .roadmap-item { grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr; padding: 16px; }
    .status { grid-column: 2; }
  }
</style>
